From January 24 to October 17, 2018, 15 patients with mild to moderate hearing loss were enroled in the Phase I trial at the UK site (Fig.
1
); 3 patients received 3 intratympanic doses of 25 µg LY3056480, 6 received 3 doses of 125 µg, and 3 and 3 patients received 3 doses of 200 µg and 250 µg, respectively.
